<main class="article-body">
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Who I am</h2>
    <p>I'm David Robles, LMSW, a psychotherapist and U.S. Army veteran. Through my private practice, Therapy by David, I work with adults 18 and older in Pasadena and across Texas. The work is direct, practical, and structured.</p>

    <h2>Credentials</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Licensed Master Social Worker (LMSW) in Texas</li>
      <li>Master of Social Work (MSW), Baylor University</li>
      <li>U.S. Army veteran</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Services</h2>
    <p>I work with adults on:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/anxiety-therapy">Anxiety and overthinking</a></li>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/trauma-therapy">Trauma and PTSD</a></li>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/depression-therapy">Depression</a></li>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/burnout-overthinking">Burnout and chronic stress</a></li>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/couples-therapy">Couples therapy</a></li>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/mens-mental-health">Men's mental health</a></li>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/veterans-military-families">Veterans and military families</a></li>
      <li><a class="inline-link" href="/first-responders">First responders</a>: law enforcement, fire, EMS, and healthcare professionals</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Session formats</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Telehealth:</strong> secure video sessions, available anywhere in Texas, including Pasadena. You need to be in Texas during the session.</li>
      <li><strong>In person:</strong> at my office in the Clear Lake area of Houston, 1335 Regents Park Dr #140, Houston, TX 77058. There is no separate office in Pasadena.</li>
      <li>Sessions are 50 minutes.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How to book</h2>
    <p>Every new client starts with a free 15-minute phone consultation. Book it at <a class="inline-link" href="/intake">therapybydavid.com/intake</a>: answer a few quick questions, then pick a time. You can also call <a class="inline-link" href="tel:8325442562">(832) 544-2562</a>.</p>
    <p>Answers to common questions are on the <a class="inline-link" href="/faq">FAQ page</a>.</p>
